{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05830","headline":"早春行 · 王维","name":"早春行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫梅发初遍，黄鸟歌犹澁。\n谁家折杨女，弄春如不及。\n爱水看妆坐，羞人映花立。\n香畏风吹散，衣愁露沾湿。\n玉闺青门里，日落香车入。\n游衍益相思，含啼向彩帷。\n忆君长入梦，归晚更生疑。\n不及红檐燕，双栖绿草时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05830.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05830","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}